<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p><code>not_found.js</code> reads the requested path: for <code>/opinion/&lt;cluster id&gt;/</code> it swaps the message and shows <em>Open this opinion on CourtListener</em> for that cluster. For it to see the path, the host must serve <code>404.html</code> for missing routes without redirecting; <code>python3 -m http.server</code> does not, Netlify and most static hosts do.</p></div>

